---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Francisco Cucullu" description="Senior product leader with a founder mindset. From economics and trading software to founding products and leading enterprise teams.">
    <div class="stack gap-20">
        <main class="wrapper about">
            <div class="about-hero" data-reveal>
            <Hero
                title="Senior Product Leader.<br/>Founder mindset."
                display
                align="center"
                tagline="Product, software, business, and companies I started myself."
                data-fast-scroll="scroll_to_about_start"
            >
                <p class="sr-only">Francisco Cucullu pitching at South Summit</p>
            </Hero>
            </div>

            <section data-reveal>
                <h2 class="section-title">Summary</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        Over fifteen years I’ve led software products. I also build them, and I have founded them. Here’s the walkthrough.
                    </p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>
                    <p><strong>Economics, then markets.</strong> A degree from the University of Buenos Aires and then a dual MSc in Quantitative Finance at Solvay, Brussels, and Universidad de San Andrés. I started in banking, then moved into the markets.</p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p><strong>Then the software.</strong> First automating business performance management at HSBC, then the trading desk at IOL, Argentina’s largest retail broker. An FX engine, 21 scrapers, a desk that stopped spending five hours a day on reconciliation. I built my own quantitative trading team.</p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p><strong>From building to leading.</strong> I moved to the startup world with Xcapit, where I led a team of five PhDs — the most qualified team I’ve ever had. At Hastee, 13 engineers across three teams: product, forward-deployed engineers, and tech support. Everything aligned with the roadmap.</p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p><strong>I also started companies.</strong> FlexRent, from zero to a community and angel investment. Timed Integrations, built and sold to Factorial. Pepino, a B2B SaaS with seven agencies. Not just an engineer: I think about the business.</p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p><strong>Then the scale.</strong> At Foundever I led four squads, 24 engineers, a flagship AI product in production for a global CX company. And now back to the startup world, scaling Telgea.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section data-reveal>
                <h2 class="section-title">Career</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Product Engineer</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">Telgea (telecom for global teams) | 2026 - Present</span>
                        <p>Whatever the product needs: revenue features, new revenue streams, process design and <a href="/blog/wasp-framework">development methodology</a>. Ideation to production.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Senior AI/ML Product Manager</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">Foundever (via IAG) | 2024 - 2026</span>
                        <p>Led a flagship multi-modal AI suite for a global CX leader (170K+ employees), driving multi-million dollar annual savings and a 50% efficiency gain. 4 squads, 24 engineers. Architected to scale to 9M+ daily interactions and 20K+ users. Presented at the <a href="/blog/speaking-coach-summit">Coach Summit</a>. <a href="/blog/ai-quality-assurance">Read more</a></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>CPTO & Co-founder (part-time)</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">The Pepino Brand | 2025 - 2026 (concurrent with Foundever)</span>
                        <p>Co-founded a B2B SaaS for digital asset management. Rebuilt product from scratch. Closed 7 agencies including Credo and BBK Foundation. Team of 3. <a href="/blog/pepino-brand">Read more</a></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Founder (Micro-SaaS, sold to Factorial)</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">Timed Integrations | 2024</span>
                        <p>Built ERP integrations for Factorial's Italian market. Automated time tracking data ingestion. Solo founder, built and sold. <a href="/blog/timed-integrations">Read more</a></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Tech Product Manager</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">Hastee (HR/Fintech) | 2023 - 2024</span>
                        <p>Increased engineering output 137%. Led 13 engineers across 3 teams. Integrated with multiple EU ERP systems. Aligned roadmap with C-level objectives. <a href="/blog/hastee">Read more</a></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Founder & Product Lead</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">FlexRent | 2023</span>
                        <p>Room exchange platform for digital nomads. 620 community members, 32 paying customers. Pitched at <a href="/blog/speaking-south-summit">South Summit</a>, <a href="/blog/speaking-warsaw">Warsaw</a>, and <a href="/blog/speaking-des-malaga">DES Málaga</a>. Featured on <a href="/blog/speaking-tv-interview">TV</a> and <a href="/blog/speaking-radio-interview">radio</a>. Angel investment secured. Team of up to 9. <a href="/blog/flexrent">Read more</a></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Engineering Manager</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">Xcapit (AI + Blockchain) | 2019 - 2023</span>
                        <p><a href="/blog/custom-ai-ml">AI-powered wealth management</a>. $2M portfolio, <a href="/blog/bayesian-optimization">400%+ annual returns</a>. <a href="/blog/xcapit-pivot">Then the pivot</a>: credit for people with no banking history, helping hundreds escape the poverty trap. Team of 5 PhDs. Funded by <a href="https://app.digitalpublicgoods.net/a/11545">UNICEF</a> and Ethereum Foundation. <a href="https://www.corporatevision-news.com/winners/xcapit/">AI Innovation Award</a>. Featured in <a href="https://www.cronista.com/infotechnology/finanzas-digitales/la-unica-inversion-que-hoy-paga-400-en-dolares-sin-riesgo-argentino-ni-impuestos/">Cronista</a> and <a href="https://www.criptonoticias.com/comunidad/ceo-xcapit-defi-democraticas-porque-barreras-mas-bajas/">CriptoNoticias</a>.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Quant Trader → Business Intelligence Lead</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">IOL (Argentina's largest retail broker) | 2017 - 2019</span>
                        <p>Built <a href="/blog/fx-arbitrage">FX arbitrage engine</a> capturing ~20% market share. <a href="/blog/competitive-intelligence">21 scrapers</a> monitoring every competitor. Cut churn 32% via ML segmentation. Onboarding 72h → 24h. Led team of 4. <a href="/blog/rpa-trading-desk">Automated 5h/day</a> of manual work.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role">
                        <strong>Business Performance Management</strong>
                        <span class="role-meta">HSBC Bank | Earlier career</span>
                        <p>Client relations specialist managing high-end investment products. Every HSBC branch in Argentina ran through my reports: operational metrics for the whole network. Built <a href="/blog/rpa-trading-desk">RPA automation tools</a>. Foundation for data, technology, and product leadership.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="achievements" data-reveal>
                <h2 class="section-title">Key Achievements</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p><strong>24 engineers, four squads</strong><br />Enterprise product in production for a global CX company. Multi-million dollar savings and a 50% efficiency gain. The technology is AI. <a href="/blog/ai-quality-assurance">Read more</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>137% engineering output</strong><br />Redesigned delivery at Hastee, leading 13 engineers across 3 teams. <a href="/blog/hastee">Read more</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>Micro-SaaS sold to Factorial</strong><br />Built ERP integrations for the Italian market. Solo founder, built and sold. <a href="/blog/timed-integrations">Read the story</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>Startup to angel investment</strong><br />Founded FlexRent, built a community of 620 members, pitched at South Summit and other stages, secured angel funding. <a href="/blog/flexrent">Read more</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>20% of a market, via automation</strong><br />21 real-time scrapers covering every competitor in the Argentine FX market. <a href="/blog/competitive-intelligence">Read more</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>UNICEF Digital Public Good</strong><br />Led a team of 5 PhDs. An open-source wallet that helped hundreds of people escape the poverty trap, and an AI Innovation Award. <a href="https://app.digitalpublicgoods.net/a/11545">See recognition</a></p>
                    <div class="spacer"></div>

                    <p><strong>On stage and on TV</strong><br /><a href="/blog/speaking-south-summit">South Summit</a>, <a href="/blog/speaking-warsaw">Warsaw</a>, <a href="/blog/speaking-des-malaga">DES Málaga</a>, the <a href="/blog/speaking-coach-summit">Coach Summit</a>, <a href="/blog/speaking-tv-interview">101 TV</a>, <a href="/blog/speaking-radio-interview">radio</a>, and a <a href="/blog/speaking-video-interview">video interview</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section data-reveal>
                <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        <strong>Dual MSc in Quantitative Finance</strong><br />
                        Solvay Brussels School of Economics & Management (Belgium)<br />
                        Universidad de San Andres (Argentina)
                    </p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p>
                        <strong>BSc in Economics</strong><br />
                        Universidad de Buenos Aires (Argentina)
                    </p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Executive Education</strong><br />
                        Harvard Business School, Management & Leadership Program
                    </p>
                    <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
                    <p>
                        <strong>CFA Level I</strong><br />
                        CFA Institute
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </main>

        <ContactCTA />
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  window?.datafast("surfed-to-about");
</script>
<style>
    .about {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3.5rem;
    }

    .about-hero {
        margin-top: -3.5rem;
        margin-inline: -1.5rem;
        width: calc(100% + 3rem);
    }

    .about-hero :global(.hero) {
        min-height: clamp(26rem, 54vw, 36rem);
        justify-content: flex-end;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 2rem;
        background-image:
            linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(19, 28, 74, 0.08) 0%, rgba(19, 28, 74, 0.05) 46%, rgba(19, 28, 74, 0.82) 100%),
            url('/assets/at-work.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center 48%;
        color: #f7f4ee;
    }

    .about-hero :global(.title),
    .about-hero :global(.tagline) {
        color: #f7f4ee;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .about-hero :global(.title.display) {
        max-width: 24ch;
    }

    section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--gray-200);
    }

    .section-title {
        grid-column-start: 1;
        font-size: var(--text-xl);
        color: var(--gray-0);
    }

    .content {
        grid-column: 2 / 4;
    }

    .content :global(a) {
        color: var(--accent-dark);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
        transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
    }

    .content :global(a:hover),
    .content :global(a:focus) {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: currentColor;
    }

    strong {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        color: var(--gray-0);
    }

    .role {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .role strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .role-meta {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--gray-400);
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .role p {
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .spacer {
        height: 16px;
    }

    .spacer-sm {
        height: 12px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 50em) {
        .about {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
        }

        .about > :global(:first-child) {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        section {
            display: contents;
            font-size: var(--text-lg);
        }
    }

    @media (min-width: 83rem) {
        .about-hero {
            margin-inline: calc(-1 * ((100vw - 83rem) / 2 + 1.5rem));
            width: 100vw;
        }
    }
</style>
